--- the engine draws the numbers, times and dates as text; the thumbnails are 240x135 like the NO DATA one.
--- NOT measurable from the sheet: where the native game puts the entries. Two columns of three rows inside the panel,
--- PREV / NEXT as invisible 280x60 tap areas at the bottom of the panel with the page text between them, are estimates.
